{"id":"e07090c199ebf13e","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glsp-logic.md","title":"The Polymodal Truth System GLSP","display":"df-glsp-logic — The Polymodal Truth System GLSP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glsp-logic","aliases":["89-df-glsp-logic"],"display":"df-glsp-logic — The Polymodal Truth System GLSP","depends_on":["[[89-df-glp-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glsp-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glsp-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glsp-logic — The Polymodal Truth System GLSP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5518caddec83ace1\" href=\"?note=5518caddec83ace1\" title=\"89-df-glp-logic\">89-df-glp-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span>；所有反射实例中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSP}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLP}\\cup\\{[n]A\\to A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSP}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLP}\\cup\\{[n]A\\to A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 p.207，GLSP。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>唯一新增闭包规则是 MP；不把任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 必然化加入真值系统。空的额外假设给全部 GLP 定理；有限个反射模式可在一次推导中使用。</p>\n<p>原书同页陈述 GLP、GLSP 的算术完全性。本条只固定真值系统的句法，迭代理论翻译及其可靠性/完全性仍为明确待扩充边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glp-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glp-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSP}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLP}\\cup\\{[n]A\\to A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"[n]","display":false}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glp-logic]]、[[89-df-glsp-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GLP（p.207）：[[89-df-polymodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glp-logic]] → [[89-df-glsp-logic]] → [[89-lem-glp-finite-support]]；与 GLB 的连接见 [[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["5518caddec83ace1"]}